<title>BELGIUM: EU says Boeing deal meets its rules threshold.</title>
<headline>EU says Boeing deal meets its rules threshold.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Competition Commissioner Karel Van Miert said on Wednesday that it was quite clear that the deal between Boeing and McDonnell Douglas met the turnover thresholds of EU merger rules.</p>
</text>
